 On The Internet This Week\"</strong></a></p><h2>15.</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d2431f56a3fb8518593809071ff6d495217d3afe6e51b735922d2fb4f9cea5dd/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbuzzfeed_articles_778%2Fc9040e515c37b868ec07e5e35ce33cf0.jpg\" alt=\"Text describing a dream about a butterfly confirming a message from a deceased mother-in-law\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"960\" height=\"481\" /></p></figure><h2>16.</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8839dbe026f44c2d523334c858a5affa3563ffc72cd821bb265643cb0691f50e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbuzzfeed_articles_778%2Fba5de7da8d6fd268cccc8d5c12d366d9.jpg\" alt=\"Summary of text: A parent recounts a frightening experience with their young son who seemed scared and saw a shadow creature\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"960\" height=\"693\" /></p></figure><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f14ce80e05a4f977af5c985e32dae347e07f5c68d0141efdca69b78b7c0da298/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbuzzfeed_articles_778%2F5b56dd5c737de1926431f58356011abf.jpg\" alt=\"A young person lies awake in bed, partially covered by patterned blankets, looking towards the camera with a thoughtful expression\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" width=\"960\" height=\"643\" /></p><figcaption><p><p>Paramount / Everett Collection</p></p></figcaption></figure><h2>17.</h2><figure><p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0d3c4556f227da4a2fda128afdaf34abf1316670daf6842515e532f1f0e3faff/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fbuzzfeed_articles_778%2Fdb37cff4fb2c4df48315ba6deed3ba26.jpg\" 